{"version":"1.0.0","description":"Cascading primary-care screening: single chief complaint then focused branch only.","level1":{"id":"chief_complaint","kind":"fixed","type":"single","text":"What is the main problem you are facing today? (choose one)","text_kn":"ಇಂದು ನೀವು ಎದುರಿಸುತ್ತಿರುವ ಮುಖ್ಯ ಸಮಸ್ಯೆ ಯಾವುದು? (ಒಂದನ್ನು ಆಯ್ಕೆ ಮಾಡಿ)","options":[{"id":"backache","label":"Backache","label_kn":"ಬೆನ್ನು ನೋವು"},{"id":"depressed_mood","label":"Depressed mood","label_kn":"ಖಿನ್ನತೆ / ಮನಸ್ಸು ಚಿಂತಿತ"},{"id":"heartburn","label":"Heartburn / Acidity","label_kn":"ಎದೆಯುರಿ / ಆಮ್ಲತೆ"},{"id":"tiredness","label":"Tiredness","label_kn":"ಆಯಾಸ"},{"id":"pimple","label":"Pimples / Acne","label_kn":"ಮೊಡವೆ"},{"id":"sneezing","label":"Sneezing","label_kn":"ಸೀನುವುದು"},{"id":"hairloss","label":"Hair loss","label_kn":"ಕೂದಲು ಉದುರುವುದು"},{"id":"fever","label":"Fever","label_kn":"ಜ್ವರ"},{"id":"stomach_pain","label":"Stomach pain","label_kn":"ಹೊಟ್ಟೆ ನೋವು"},{"id":"body_pains","label":"Body pains","label_kn":"ದೇಹ ನೋವು"},{"id":"muscle_pain","label":"Muscle pain","label_kn":"ಸ್ನಾಯು ನೋವು"},{"id":"tooth_ache","label":"Tooth ache","label_kn":"ಹಲ್ಲು ನೋವು"},{"id":"breathing_difficulty","label":"Breathing difficulty","label_kn":"ಉಸಿರಾಟದ ತೊಂದರೆ","preTriage":"urgent"},{"id":"urine_infection","label":"Urine infection","label_kn":"ಮೂತ್ರ ಸೋಂಕು"},{"id":"constipation","label":"Constipation","label_kn":"ಮಲಬದ್ಧತೆ"},{"id":"heart_related","label":"Heart-related","label_kn":"ಹೃದಯ ಸಂಬಂಧಿ","preTriage":"urgent"},{"id":"gastric","label":"Gastric problem","label_kn":"ಜಠರ ಸಮಸ್ಯೆ"},{"id":"other","label":"Other","label_kn":"ಇತರೆ","text":"required"}]},"complaints":{"backache":{"level2":[{"id":"backache_duration","type":"single","text":"How long have you had this back pain?","text_kn":"ಈ ಬೆನ್ನು ನೋವು ಎಷ್ಟು ದಿನಗಳಿಂದ ಇದೆ?","options":[{"id":"lt_3d","label":"Less than 3 days","label_kn":"೩ ದಿನಗಳಿಗಿಂತ ಕಡಿಮೆ"},{"id":"1_2w","label":"1 to 2 weeks","label_kn":"೧ ರಿಂದ ೨ ವಾರ"},{"id":"gt_6w","label":"More than 6 weeks","label_kn":"೬ ವಾರಗಳಿಗಿಂತ ಹೆಚ್ಚು